 "reperes|L'heure": "La hora",
 "reperes|« Il est 3 h » : It's three o'clock. Pour la demie : half past three ; pour le quart : a quarter past three (3 h 15), a quarter to four (3 h 45). On compte sur 12 heures : 3 p.m. = 15 h, 3 a.m. = 3 h du matin.": "«Son las 3»: It's three o'clock. Para la media: half past three; para el cuarto: a quarter past three (3:15), a quarter to four (3:45). Se cuenta en 12 horas: 3 p.m. = las 15:00, 3 a.m. = las 3 de la mañana.",
